	(text "J3 Wi-Fi (E-key): PCIe on RK3588 pcie2x1l2 / combo PHY 0, Bluetooth on USB 2.\nJ4 5G modem (B-key): USB 3 + USB 2 from the hub, SIM on J5.\nVCC_MODEM is a dedicated 3.3 V rail sized for transmit bursts.\nMODEM_PWR_EN high switches the modem on (card pulls it low by default).\nMODEM_RESET_H high resets the modem (transistor pulls the card's 1.8 V reset pin low).\nMODEM_VCC_EN switches the whole VCC_MODEM rail, for a hard power cycle.\nSIM detect is not wired in rev A: the holder has no switch, so no SIM hot-swap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5e2a7dd8-c95f-5bfa-9af0-5e8fef196c23")
	)
